{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>לא תקיפו</b> in gematria: both the one who rounds and the one who is rounded are liable." "<b>ולא תשחית</b> in gematria: זהו תער (this is a razor), and not scissors." "<b>פאת זקנך</b> And adjacent to it: ושרט לנפש — to say: just as one is liable for the pe'ah in five pe'ot, so too one is liable if he made five scratchings with five fingers."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:05.321068811Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}